# CandleStickChart

## Overview

A complete candlestick chart component that composes `ChartHeader`, `ChartLegend`, `DataDisplay`, `CandleStickGroup`, and `ChartFooter` into a cohesive OHLC data visualization. Uses D3 for scaling and the CSS cascade for consistent styling via DataVis palette tokens and brand CSS engine.

**This component follows the [Organized Props Pattern](./OrganizedPropsPattern.md).**

## Figma Reference

- **Node ID**: `911-53008`
- **Design File**: DataVis-Components
- **Figma URL**: https://www.figma.com/design/uA5ExvS0cNXbDEKzT9Rnrt/DataVis-Components?node-id=911-53008

## Architecture

```
CandleStickChart (flex container, vertical layout)
├── ChartHeader (conditional, when chartHeader=true)
│   ├── ChartTitle
│   └── ChartSubtitle
├── ChartLegend (conditional, when chartLegend=true)
│   └── ChartKey[] (auto-generated or manual)
│       ├── Indicator (circle, line, or dashed)
│       └── Label + optional DataHead
├── DataDisplay (conditional, when dataDisplay=true)
│   ├── contentLeft
│   │   ├── mainLabel
│   │   └── DataHead (DataLead + SupportingData + SupportingLabel)
│   └── contentRight (Badge)
├── CandleStickGroup (flex-grow)
│   ├── YAxis (optional, when yAxis=true)
│   │   └── ChartAxisTick (for each tick value)
│   └── contentWrapper (flex, space-between)
│       ├── AvgLine (optional, absolute positioned)
│       └── CandleStick[] (D3-scaled, one per data point)
│           ├── top dot (conditional: wickDots, Colour/surface [2 Surface: fg bold])
│           ├── high wick (on-Colour/high, crispEdges)
│           ├── candle body (brand: categorical/bold, semantic: positive/negative)
│           ├── low wick (on-Colour/high, crispEdges)
│           └── bottom dot (conditional: wickDots, Colour/surface [2 Surface: fg bold])
│   └── XAxis (optional, when xAxis=true)
└── ChartFooter (conditional, when chartFooter=true)
    ├── annotationLeft
    └── annotationRight
```

## Import

```tsx
import CandleStickChart from "./charts/CandleStickChart";
```

## Data Format

### CandleStickDataPoint (Canonical)

```tsx
import { CandleStickDataPoint } from "../types/chart-data";

const data: CandleStickDataPoint[] = [
  { category: "23:00", open: 400, close: 700, high: 900, low: 200 },
  { category: "1:00", open: 500, close: 650, high: 850, low: 350 },
  { category: "3:00", open: 300, close: 550, high: 750, low: 150 },
  { category: "5:00", open: 600, close: 480, high: 800, low: 300 },
];
```

Each data point must provide:

| Field        | Type                       | Description                         |
| ------------ | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| `category`   | `string \| number \| Date` | X-axis label                        |
| `open`       | `number`                   | Opening value                       |
| `close`      | `number`                   | Closing value                       |
| `high`       | `number`                   | Highest value (>= max(open, close)) |
| `low`        | `number`                   | Lowest value (<= min(open, close))  |
| `id`         | `string \| number` (opt)   | Stable key for animations           |
| `color`      | `string` (opt)             | Custom color override               |
| `colorIndex` | `number` (opt)             | Categorical color index (1-6)       |

